open-source license best suited to their domain.


Component License Index
-----------------------

| Directory / Scope | Component | License | SPDX Identifier | Full Text |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `firmware/` | Embedded firmware, `tandem_core`, `tandem_hal`, board headers, native tests | GNU General Public License v3.0 | `GPL-3.0-only` | [firmware/LICENSE](firmware/LICENSE) |
| `configurator/` | Tandem Configurator web application (`index.html`, `app.js`, `style.css`, `serve.py`) | GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 | `AGPL-3.0-only` | [configurator/LICENSE](configurator/LICENSE) |
| `hardware/` | KiCad schematics, PCB layouts, BOMs, and electrical design files | CERN Open Hardware Licence v2 (Strongly Reciprocal) | `CERN-OHL-S-2.0` | [hardware/LICENSE](hardware/LICENSE) |
| `mechanical/` | 3D models, parametric CAD files, enclosures, gimbals, and grips | Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International | `CC-BY-SA-4.0` | [mechanical/LICENSE](mechanical/LICENSE) |
| Root, `docs/`, `tools/`, `.github/` | Documentation, build/CI/test scripts, workflows, and any root-level files unless noted otherwise | GNU General Public License v3.0 | `GPL-3.0-only` | [firmware/LICENSE](firmware/LICENSE) |

Note on `configurator/` network deployment: Under `AGPL-3.0-only`, if you modify
the Tandem Configurator web application and host or serve a modified version to
users over a network, you must make the corresponding source code of your
modified version available to those users under the terms of `AGPL-3.0-only`.


